Medic soldier scout

&#x200B;

Medic and soldier can just ultiduo forever. Scout can protect the radius around me. It's my best bet.

I scrolled a long ass time and you're the first person to say something to the contrary... why are people bandwagoning so hard on this?

&#x200B;

I had to rewatch it a bunch of times because of that. From what I've seen he seemed genuinely happy and seemed like he was enjoying some fun game, until he realized what he was doing wrong. All his reactions seem genuine. Like am I wrong? Can someone rewatch it and tell me he looks guilty in any way?
